# CAMBER on its second track, FURNACE, at the game's own defaults (RATE
# 60 FPS, class BRISK, mode RACE). Run with --boot off --fps 60
# --frames 1101.
#
# Home screen: one step right to the CAMBER tile; A (south) at 110 opens
# the game. DOWN (200) to TRACK, RIGHT (230) from LAGOON to FURNACE, UP
# (300) back to PLAY. A on PLAY (330) starts the race and stays held
# from here on as the throttle; GO! shows at about 510.
90 press right
91 release right
110 press south
111 release south
200 press down
201 release down
230 press right
231 release right
300 press up
301 release up
330 press south
# From 500 the ship drives itself by these lines: every 4 pictures the
# stick points at the middle of the road seen on two rows, and B (east),
# the air brake, is pulled when the road runs far off to one side. A
# closed-loop helper wrote these lines by looking at each picture; they
# are plain inputs and replay the same race every time.
# About 640 to 720: over a long blue pad. About 820 to 1000: into the
# first tunnel through the rock, dark inside, and out again.
